precinct: salary economy, patrol dispatch, commissary, side games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable in <strong>English and Arabic</strong>, with full right-to-left support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The case is open, Detective. The desk is yours.</p>", "short_description": "Read the evidence. Run the forensics. Question suspects in your own words, they lie, crack, or lawyer up. Accuse the wrong person, and Internal Affairs comes after you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935210/1e3effd7f0099784b5f2d03af60f464e904ece18/header.jpg?t=1788272635", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935210/8f4ba8c9fa3f888f186b75ba08d29929bbb0cc5a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788272635", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935210/8f4ba8c9fa3f888f186b75ba08d29929bbb0cc5a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788272635", "website": "https://shulalab.com/homicidedesk", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz (Intel Core i3 / AMD equivalent, 2015 or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with WebGL / DirectX 11 support (Intel HD 4000 or better)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 13000 MB MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any DirectX-compatible sound device</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</